0 FILE paired-door-sync.ldr
0 PairedDoorSync - synchronized opposed door leaves
0 Name: paired-door-sync.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/paired-door-sync.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // One SPIKE medium motor on A drives one 16T pinion.
0 // Two opposed 64781 racks ride toggles on two horizontal guide axles;
0 // the leaves are carried by the racks. Law: x_front = -x_back.
0 // Standard LDraw geometry is external and retains its original author/license.
